# steps/table-receiver.md §8 (was slice 2's refusal "convert.lm2: cannot read a table file of the
# translator"): a program that converts nothing (its whole body is the letter to the host) and has no
# `primitive.convert` among its source tables (harness Table = absent) needs none -- it translates and
# runs: Entry 7.  One that converts is refused at the edge (unit_s7_conv_table_asks_refused).

sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
